#. text
#: launcher.cpp:258 launcher.cpp:3087
msgid "VSync"
msgstr "VSync"

#: launcher.cpp:259
msgid "Wait for the display's refresh: no tearing."
msgstr "Menunggu refresh layar: tanpa tearing."

#: launcher.cpp:260
msgid "Frame rate cap"
msgstr "Batas FPS"

#: launcher.cpp:261
msgid "20 and 30: an even pace instead of the highest rate the PC reaches. 120, 144 and Unlocked (experimental): the game runs past its 60 at its own speed, as far as the PC and, with VSync, the monitor take it; frame generation is off with them, and the game goes back to 60 once it goes online for multiplayer. With frame generation, off follows the monitor."
msgstr "20 dan 30: tempo rata, bukan frame rate tertinggi yang bisa dicapai PC. 120, 144 dan Tak terkunci (eksperimental): game berjalan melewati 60 aslinya dengan kecepatannya sendiri, sejauh yang sanggup diikuti PC dan, dengan VSync, monitor; frame generation nonaktif dengan pilihan ini, dan game kembali ke 60 begitu masuk online untuk multiplayer. Dengan frame generation, Nonaktif mengikuti monitor."

#: launcher.cpp:265
msgid "Frame rate display"
msgstr "Tampilan frame rate"

#: launcher.cpp:266
msgid "On screen shows FPS, frame time, the CPU's, GPU's, PPU's, SPU's and RSX's load and a graph of the last frames' times, in the top right corner."
msgstr "Di layar menampilkan FPS, waktu frame, beban CPU, GPU, PPU, SPU dan RSX, serta grafik waktu frame-frame terakhir, di pojok kanan atas."

#: launcher.cpp:268
msgid "Ultrawide"
msgstr "Ultrawide"

#: launcher.cpp:269
msgid "Draws the game to the full width of a wider screen. The HUD, menus and movies stay 16:9. Takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "Menggambar game memenuhi seluruh lebar layar yang lebih lebar. HUD, menu dan video tetap 16:9. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:270
msgid "Shader build indicator"
msgstr "Indikator kompilasi shader"

#: launcher.cpp:271
msgid "A spinner in the bottom left corner while the game's new shaders are built, as RPCS3 shows."
msgstr "Ikon berputar di pojok kiri bawah selama shader baru game dikompilasi, seperti di RPCS3."

#: launcher.cpp:273
msgid "HDR10 on a display Windows has HDR on for (Settings, System, Display, Use HDR): the game's picture with its highlights raised toward the peak below, the rest at paper white. Not with frame generation. Takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "HDR10 pada layar yang HDR-nya diaktifkan di Windows (Pengaturan, Sistem, Tampilan, Gunakan HDR): gambar game dengan bagian terangnya dinaikkan menuju kecerahan puncak di bawah, sisanya pada putih kertas. Tidak bisa bersama frame generation. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:276
msgid "HDR peak brightness"
msgstr "Kecerahan HDR"

#: launcher.cpp:277
msgid "How bright the brightest highlights get: fire, the sky, lightning. Auto takes what the display reports."
msgstr "Seberapa terang bagian paling terang: api, langit, petir. Otomatis memakai nilai yang dilaporkan layar."

#: launcher.cpp:278
msgid "HDR paper white"
msgstr "Putih kertas HDR"

#: launcher.cpp:279
msgid "How bright white is in the rest of the picture and the HUD. Raise it in a bright room."
msgstr "Seberapa terang warna putih di bagian gambar lainnya dan di HUD. Naikkan di ruangan yang terang."

#: launcher.cpp:280
msgid "Window style"
msgstr "Gaya jendela"

#: launcher.cpp:281
msgid "How this window looks: Clean, smooth at every Windows scale, or Retro, a pixel font and 8-bit bevels. The game is not changed."
msgstr "Tampilan jendela ini: Bersih, halus di setiap skala Windows, atau Retro, font piksel dan tepi timbul 8-bit. Game tidak berubah."

#: launcher.cpp:283
msgid "Retro effects"
msgstr "Efek retro"

#: launcher.cpp:284
msgid "Scanlines and a neon glow in this window, with the Retro window style. The game is not changed."
msgstr "Scanline dan cahaya neon di jendela ini, dengan gaya jendela Retro. Game tidak berubah."

#: launcher.cpp:285
msgid "Graphics card"
msgstr "Kartu grafis"

#: launcher.cpp:286
msgid "Internal resolution"
msgstr "Resolusi internal"

#: launcher.cpp:287
msgid "What the scene is drawn at. Shadow resolution and Effects resolution below say how large shadows, bloom and blur are drawn. AMD FSR and frame generation go no higher than the window."
msgstr "Resolusi tempat adegan digambar. Resolusi bayangan dan Resolusi efek di bawah menentukan seberapa besar bayangan, bloom dan blur digambar. AMD FSR dan frame generation tidak melebihi ukuran jendela."

#: launcher.cpp:289
msgid "Shadow resolution"
msgstr "Resolusi bayangan"

#: launcher.cpp:290
msgid "Shadow maps drawn larger: finer shadow edges and less stair-stepping, most of all at a high internal resolution; where the game's shadows are soft the change is small. 4x takes about 120 MB more video memory. Takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "Shadow map digambar lebih besar: tepi bayangan lebih halus dan efek tangga berkurang, terutama pada resolusi internal tinggi; di tempat bayangan game memang lembut, perubahannya kecil. 4x memakai sekitar 120 MB memori video lebih banyak. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:293
msgid "Effects resolution"
msgstr "Resolusi efek"

#: launcher.cpp:294
msgid "Bloom, blur and depth of field drawn at the internal resolution, not at the game's 640x360 and smaller: smoother blurred backgrounds and glow at 1440p and 4K, the game's brightness kept. Only with an internal resolution above 720p. Takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "Bloom, blur dan depth of field digambar pada resolusi internal, bukan pada ukuran asli game, 640x360 dan lebih kecil: latar belakang buram dan cahaya lebih halus pada 1440p dan 4K, kecerahan game tetap. Hanya dengan resolusi internal di atas 720p. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:297
msgid "Field of view"
msgstr "Bidang pandang"

#: launcher.cpp:298
msgid "How wide the view is in play, against the game's: wider shows more around Kratos, narrower brings the view in. The in-engine cinematics keep the game's own. Takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "Seberapa lebar pandangan saat bermain, dibanding aslinya: lebih lebar menampilkan lebih banyak di sekitar Kratos, lebih sempit mendekatkan pandangan. Sinematik dalam engine tetap memakai aslinya. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:300
msgid "Ambient occlusion"
msgstr "Ambient occlusion"

#: launcher.cpp:301
msgid "Soft shade in corners, gaps and where things meet the ground, for a deeper picture, worked out from the scene's depth before the HUD goes on. High draws it at the internal resolution, On at half of it. Off with an ultrawide picture. Takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "Bayangan lembut di sudut, celah dan tempat benda menyentuh tanah, agar gambar terasa lebih dalam, dihitung dari kedalaman adegan sebelum HUD digambar. Tinggi menggambarnya pada resolusi internal, Aktif pada setengahnya. Nonaktif pada gambar ultrawide. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:304
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "Penskalaan"

#: launcher.cpp:305
msgid "How the picture is scaled to the window. AMD FSR builds the detail from past frames, in place of SMAA, and FSR 1 takes over where there is no scene. NVIDIA DLSS does the same with NVIDIA's model on RTX cards (beta), its mode set by the internal resolution against the window (DLAA when they match); its DLL comes from NVIDIA's own GitHub when you pick it."
msgstr "Cara gambar diskalakan ke jendela. AMD FSR menyusun detail dari frame sebelumnya, menggantikan SMAA, dan FSR 1 mengambil alih bila tidak ada adegan. NVIDIA DLSS melakukan hal yang sama dengan model NVIDIA di kartu RTX (beta), modenya ditentukan oleh resolusi internal dibanding jendela (DLAA bila sama); DLL-nya diambil dari GitHub milik NVIDIA sendiri saat Anda memilihnya."

#: launcher.cpp:309
msgid "FSR version"
msgstr "Versi FSR"

#: launcher.cpp:310
msgid "Auto takes the newest the card and its driver have: FSR 4.1 on AMD Radeon RX 6000 and newer (RX 6000: driver 26.10.1 or later), else FSR 3.1. 4.1 gives cleaner edges and thin lines; 3.1 keeps textures a little sharper and is lighter on the GPU."
msgstr "Otomatis memakai versi terbaru yang dimiliki kartu dan driver-nya: FSR 4.1 di AMD Radeon RX 6000 dan yang lebih baru (RX 6000: driver 26.10.1 atau lebih baru), selain itu FSR 3.1. 4.1 memberi tepi dan garis tipis yang lebih bersih; 3.1 menjaga tekstur sedikit lebih tajam dan lebih ringan bagi GPU."

#: launcher.cpp:313
msgid "DLSS preset"
msgstr "Preset DLSS"

#: launcher.cpp:314
msgid "Only with NVIDIA DLSS. Auto lets the DLL choose for each mode (K for DLAA, Quality and Balanced, M for Performance, L for Ultra Performance). L and M are sharper with less ghosting but cost more, best on RTX 40 and newer."
msgstr "Hanya dengan NVIDIA DLSS. Otomatis membiarkan DLL memilih untuk tiap mode (K untuk DLAA, Quality dan Balanced, M untuk Performance, L untuk Ultra Performance). L dan M lebih tajam dengan ghosting lebih sedikit tetapi lebih berat, paling baik di RTX 40 dan yang lebih baru."

#: launcher.cpp:316
msgid "FSR sharpening"
msgstr "Penajaman FSR"

#: launcher.cpp:317
msgid "The sharpening pass of FSR (RCAS). Only with FSR scaling."
msgstr "Tahap penajaman FSR (RCAS). Hanya dengan penskalaan FSR."

#: launcher.cpp:318
msgid "CAS sharpening"
msgstr "Penajaman CAS"

#: launcher.cpp:319
msgid "AMD's contrast adaptive sharpening on the picture with bilinear or sharp bilinear scaling, or NVIDIA DLSS: crisper detail, edges not overdone. AMD FSR has its own (FSR sharpening). Not with frame generation."
msgstr "Penajaman adaptif kontras dari AMD pada gambar dengan penskalaan bilinear atau bilinear tajam, atau NVIDIA DLSS: detail lebih tajam, tepi tidak berlebihan. AMD FSR punya penajamannya sendiri (Penajaman FSR). Tidak bisa bersama frame generation."

#: launcher.cpp:321
msgid "Debanding"
msgstr "Debanding"

#: launcher.cpp:322
msgid "Smooths the steps in dark gradients, fog and skies, with a fine grain; edges and texture stay as they are. Not with frame generation."
msgstr "Menghaluskan garis bertingkat pada gradasi gelap, kabut dan langit, dengan butiran halus; tepi dan tekstur tetap seperti semula. Tidak bisa bersama frame generation."

#: launcher.cpp:324
msgid "Colour vibrance"
msgstr "Vibrance warna"

#: launcher.cpp:325
msgid "Livelier colours: the dull ones raised the most, skin and colours that are strong already far less. On the whole picture, the game's HUD and menus too."
msgstr "Warna lebih hidup: warna kusam dinaikkan paling banyak, kulit dan warna yang sudah kuat jauh lebih sedikit. Berlaku pada seluruh gambar, termasuk HUD dan menu game."

#: launcher.cpp:327
msgid "Contrast"
msgstr "Kontras"

#: launcher.cpp:328
msgid "Lit surfaces and highlights stand out more; deep shadows keep their detail, black and white kept."
msgstr "Permukaan yang tersinari dan bagian terang lebih menonjol; bayangan pekat tetap detail, hitam dan putih tetap terjaga."

#: launcher.cpp:329 launcher.cpp:4742
msgid "Frame generation"
msgstr "Frame generation"

#: launcher.cpp:330
msgid "Twice the frames on screen, with VSync on: the game is held at half the monitor's refresh rate (60 at 120 Hz), a frame is made between each two, about a frame later, and below 25 it stands aside. ANR FG (beta) keeps what moves whole where AMD FSR's can tear it; chosen, the launcher offers to download it from Apex Compute's releases."
msgstr "Frame di layar jadi dua kali lipat, dengan VSync aktif: game ditahan di setengah refresh rate monitor (60 pada 120 Hz), satu frame dibuat di antara tiap dua frame, sekitar satu frame lebih lambat, dan di bawah 25 fitur ini tidak bekerja. ANR FG (beta) menjaga benda yang bergerak tetap utuh di tempat milik AMD FSR bisa merobeknya; bila dipilih, launcher menawarkan untuk mengunduhnya dari rilis Apex Compute."

#: launcher.cpp:333
msgid "NVIDIA Reflex"
msgstr "NVIDIA Reflex"

#: launcher.cpp:334
msgid "Less input lag on NVIDIA GeForce GTX 900 and newer (beta): each frame starts as late as the GPU allows, so fewer frames wait their turn when the GPU is the slower part. Boost keeps the GPU's clocks up too. Not with frame generation. Takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "Input lag lebih rendah di NVIDIA GeForce GTX 900 dan yang lebih baru (beta): tiap frame dimulai selambat yang diizinkan GPU, jadi lebih sedikit frame yang mengantre saat GPU menjadi bagian yang lebih lambat. Boost juga menjaga clock GPU tetap tinggi. Tidak bisa bersama frame generation. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:337
msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Anti-aliasing"

#: launcher.cpp:338
msgid "Smooths jagged edges after the game has drawn the frame. Costs next to nothing. AMD FSR scaling does this itself in play."
msgstr "Menghaluskan tepi bergerigi setelah game selesai menggambar frame. Hampir tanpa beban. Penskalaan AMD FSR melakukannya sendiri saat bermain."

#: launcher.cpp:340
msgid "Anisotropic filtering"
msgstr "Filter anisotropik"

#: launcher.cpp:341
msgid "Sharper textures seen at an angle. The game itself asks for none."
msgstr "Tekstur lebih tajam saat dilihat dari sudut miring. Game sendiri tidak memintanya sama sekali."

#: launcher.cpp:342
msgid "Build shaders in the background"
msgstr "Kompilasi shader di latar belakang"

#: launcher.cpp:343
msgid "A new shader is built while the game goes on, instead of a stall. Walls, floors and other solid things wait for theirs; an effect turns up a moment late."
msgstr "Shader baru dikompilasi sementara game tetap berjalan, bukan tersendat. Dinding, lantai dan benda padat lainnya menunggu shader-nya; efek muncul sesaat terlambat."

#: launcher.cpp:345
msgid "Wait for new shaders"
msgstr "Tunggu shader baru"

#: launcher.cpp:346
msgid "How long walls and floors wait for their new shaders. Short: 33 ms in all for a frame, no pause; past it a gap shows there until the shader is built. Full: up to two seconds each, no gap but a pause. Off: no wait, a gap for a moment."
msgstr "Berapa lama dinding dan lantai menunggu shader barunya. Singkat: total 33 ms per frame, tanpa jeda; lewat dari itu tampak celah di sana sampai shader selesai dikompilasi. Penuh: hingga dua detik masing-masing, tanpa celah tetapi ada jeda. Nonaktif: tanpa menunggu, ada celah sesaat."

#: launcher.cpp:349
msgid "Render thread"
msgstr "Thread render"

#: launcher.cpp:350
msgid "The GPU's work is recorded and shown on a thread of its own, beside the one that reads the game's commands: about 10% more frames where that one holds the game back."
msgstr "Pekerjaan GPU direkam dan ditampilkan di thread tersendiri, di samping thread yang membaca perintah game: frame bertambah sekitar 10% bila thread itu yang menahan game."

#: launcher.cpp:352
msgid "Build pipelines first"
msgstr "Kompilasi pipeline dulu"

#: launcher.cpp:353
msgid "At the start the game waits until the pipelines kept from earlier sessions are built, so none is built while you play: a moment, a few seconds after a GPU driver update."
msgstr "Saat mulai, game menunggu sampai pipeline yang tersimpan dari sesi sebelumnya selesai dikompilasi, jadi tidak ada yang dikompilasi saat Anda bermain: sebentar saja, beberapa detik setelah pembaruan driver GPU."

#. check_line
#: launcher.cpp:355 launcher.cpp:2978
msgid "Pixel shaders built ahead"
msgstr "Pixel shader dikompilasi lebih dulu"

#: launcher.cpp:356
msgid "The pixel shaders of the game's files are built before play, after the vertex shaders on the first start (Enter or Start leaves them for the next), or by Build all shaders now below Clear shaders: some minutes, once. Places you reach later wait for fewer of them."
msgstr "Pixel shader dari file game dikompilasi sebelum bermain, setelah vertex shader saat game pertama kali dijalankan (Enter atau Start menundanya ke lain kali), atau lewat Kompilasi shader di bawah Hapus shader: beberapa menit, sekali saja. Tempat yang Anda capai nanti lebih jarang menunggu shader."

#: launcher.cpp:359
msgid "Device"
msgstr "Perangkat"

#: launcher.cpp:360
msgid "Auto reads a controller and the keyboard and mouse at the same time: either one plays."
msgstr "Otomatis membaca kontroler serta keyboard dan mouse sekaligus: keduanya bisa dipakai bermain."

#: launcher.cpp:361
msgid "Controller API"
msgstr "API kontroler"

#: launcher.cpp:362
msgid "Auto reads a controller through XInput when it has it (Xbox, most PC pads), else through SDL3 (DualShock 4, DualSense, Switch and others). With DS4Windows, XInput, or one controller counts twice."
msgstr "Otomatis membaca kontroler lewat XInput bila didukung (Xbox, kebanyakan gamepad PC), selain itu lewat SDL3 (DualShock 4, DualSense, Switch dan lainnya). Dengan DS4Windows, pilih XInput, atau satu kontroler terhitung dua kali."

#: launcher.cpp:364
msgid "Stick dead zone"
msgstr "Zona mati stik"

#: launcher.cpp:365
msgid "How far a stick moves before it counts."
msgstr "Seberapa jauh stik bergerak sebelum terbaca."

#: launcher.cpp:366
msgid "Confirm button"
msgstr "Tombol konfirmasi"

#: launcher.cpp:367
msgid "The button that confirms in the menus."
msgstr "Tombol untuk konfirmasi di menu."

#: launcher.cpp:368
msgid "Vibration"
msgstr "Getaran"

#: launcher.cpp:368
msgid "Controller rumble."
msgstr "Getaran kontroler."

#: launcher.cpp:369
msgid "Damage to Kratos"
msgstr "Damage ke Kratos"

#: launcher.cpp:370
msgid "How much of a hit he takes. None: hits take no health from him."
msgstr "Seberapa besar serangan yang ia terima. Tidak ada: serangan tidak mengurangi darahnya."

#: launcher.cpp:371
msgid "Kratos's damage"
msgstr "Damage dari Kratos"

#: launcher.cpp:372
msgid "How much his hits take from an enemy. One hit: all of its health."
msgstr "Seberapa banyak serangannya mengurangi darah musuh. Sekali pukul: seluruh darahnya."

#: launcher.cpp:373
msgid "Max red orbs"
msgstr "Orb merah maksimal"

#: launcher.cpp:374
msgid "The red orbs are held at the most the game allows, 1,000,000. A save made with this on keeps them."
msgstr "Orb merah ditahan di jumlah terbanyak yang diizinkan game, 1.000.000. Simpanan yang dibuat saat ini aktif tetap memuatnya."

#: launcher.cpp:375
msgid "Infinite magic and items"
msgstr "Sihir dan item tak terbatas"

#: launcher.cpp:376
msgid "The magic and item meters stay full."
msgstr "Meter sihir dan item tetap penuh."

#: launcher.cpp:377
msgid "Infinite rage"
msgstr "Amarah tak terbatas"

#: launcher.cpp:378
msgid "The rage meter stays full."
msgstr "Meter amarah tetap penuh."

#: launcher.cpp:379
msgid "Infinite double jumps"
msgstr "Lompat ganda tak terbatas"

#: launcher.cpp:380
msgid "Kratos can jump again in the air, as often as he likes."
msgstr "Kratos bisa melompat lagi di udara, sesering yang ia mau."

#: launcher.cpp:381
msgid "Use mods"
msgstr "Gunakan mod"

#: launcher.cpp:382
msgid "Off: the game as it is, every mod left out. Below, each one is switched on its own."
msgstr "Nonaktif: game apa adanya, semua mod tidak dipakai. Di bawah, tiap mod diaktifkan sendiri-sendiri."

#: launcher.cpp:383
msgid "Write out the game's textures"
msgstr "Ekspor tekstur game"

#: launcher.cpp:384
msgid "For making texture mods: each texture the game loads goes once into textures-dump beside the settings, named by the id a picture in its place takes. The game is slower while it is on."
msgstr "Untuk membuat mod tekstur: tiap tekstur yang dimuat game disimpan sekali ke textures-dump di samping file pengaturan, dinamai dengan id yang dipakai gambar penggantinya. Game lebih lambat selama ini aktif."

#. text
#: launcher.cpp:386 launcher.cpp:2623 launcher.cpp:3105
msgid "Multiplayer"
msgstr "Multiplayer"

#: launcher.cpp:387
msgid "Auto: the game finds other players itself, as torrents find their peers: no host. Host: this PC runs the matchmaking, for its own game and the players who join it. Join: play through a host's PC. Then Multi-Player on the game's title screen, and Quick Play."
msgstr "Otomatis: game mencari pemain lain sendiri, seperti torrent mencari peer-nya: tanpa host. Host: PC ini menjalankan matchmaking, untuk game-nya sendiri dan pemain yang bergabung. Gabung: bermain lewat PC host. Lalu pilih Multi-Player di layar judul game, dan Quick Play."

#: launcher.cpp:390
msgid "Online ID"
msgstr "ID online"

#: launcher.cpp:391
msgid "Your name in the game: 3 to 16 letters, digits, - and _, starting with a letter. Every player needs their own."
msgstr "Nama Anda di game: 3 sampai 16 huruf, angka, - dan _, diawali huruf. Tiap pemain perlu ID sendiri."

#: launcher.cpp:393
msgid "Host's address"
msgstr "Alamat host"

#: launcher.cpp:394
msgid "To join: the address the host's Multiplayer tab shows, or the host's name."
msgstr "Untuk bergabung: alamat yang tampil di tab Multiplayer milik host, atau nama host."

#: launcher.cpp:395
msgid "Always relayed"
msgstr "Selalu lewat relay"

#: launcher.cpp:396
msgid "Your game's traffic goes by the host's PC (Host, Join) or the players' nodes (Auto) instead of straight to the other players: for a network where joining works and playing does not."
msgstr "Lalu lintas game Anda lewat PC host (Host, Gabung) atau node para pemain (Otomatis), bukan langsung ke pemain lain: untuk jaringan yang bisa bergabung tetapi tidak bisa bermain."

#: launcher.cpp:398
msgid "Open the port on the router"
msgstr "Buka port di router"

#: launcher.cpp:399
msgid "Auto: asks the router (UPnP) to let other players reach this PC, as torrent clients do. Players who can be reached carry for the ones who cannot."
msgstr "Otomatis: meminta router (UPnP) agar pemain lain bisa menjangkau PC ini, seperti klien torrent. Pemain yang bisa dijangkau meneruskan lalu lintas bagi yang tidak bisa."

#: launcher.cpp:401
msgid "Help others connect"
msgstr "Bantu pemain lain terhubung"

#: launcher.cpp:402
msgid "Auto: two players who cannot reach each other may talk through your PC (a few pairs at most)."
msgstr "Otomatis: dua pemain yang tidak bisa saling menjangkau boleh berkomunikasi lewat PC Anda (paling banyak beberapa pasang)."

#: launcher.cpp:403
msgid "Community nodes"
msgstr "Node komunitas"

#: launcher.cpp:404
msgid "Auto: nodes anyone can run on a reachable PC (scripts\\mp_p2p.py community), which introduce players and carry for them: address:port, a comma between."
msgstr "Otomatis: node yang bisa dijalankan siapa saja di PC yang bisa dijangkau (scripts\\mp_p2p.py community), yang mempertemukan pemain dan meneruskan lalu lintas mereka: alamat:port, dipisah koma."

#: launcher.cpp:406
msgid "Launcher language"
msgstr "Bahasa launcher"

#: launcher.cpp:407
msgid "The language of this window. Windows language follows Windows' display language, and English where this window has no translation. The game's own text and speech are the next row's."
msgstr "Bahasa jendela ini. Bahasa Windows mengikuti bahasa tampilan Windows, dan bahasa Inggris bila jendela ini belum punya terjemahannya. Teks dan suara game sendiri diatur di baris berikutnya."

#: launcher.cpp:409
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

#: launcher.cpp:410
msgid "The game's language: text and speech. The EU disc takes it at its first start, where it asks (Cross for this one, Triangle for Greek), and keeps it."
msgstr "Bahasa game: teks dan suara. Disk EU mengambilnya saat pertama kali dijalankan, ketika game bertanya (Silang untuk bahasa ini, Segitiga untuk bahasa Yunani), lalu tetap memakainya."

#: launcher.cpp:412
msgid "Esc closes the game"
msgstr "Esc menutup game"

#: launcher.cpp:413
msgid "Esc is not a PS3 button; off leaves it free."
msgstr "Esc bukan tombol PS3; Nonaktif membiarkannya bebas."

#: launcher.cpp:414
msgid "Save backups"
msgstr "Cadangan simpanan"

#: launcher.cpp:415
msgid "Copies kept of a save before the game writes over it."
msgstr "Jumlah salinan simpanan yang disisakan sebelum game menimpanya."

#: launcher.cpp:416
msgid "Steady audio"
msgstr "Audio stabil"

#: launcher.cpp:417
msgid "Runs the game's sound on a thread of its own, so heavy fights do not break it up."
msgstr "Menjalankan suara game di thread tersendiri, agar pertarungan berat tidak membuatnya putus-putus."

#: launcher.cpp:418
msgid "Speakers"
msgstr "Speaker"

#: launcher.cpp:419
msgid "Auto follows the output device; 7.1 for Windows Sonic or Dolby Atmos for Headphones. Surround also needs the game's Sound Mode (Options, Audio) on 5.1 or 7.1."
msgstr "Otomatis mengikuti perangkat output; 7.1 untuk Windows Sonic atau Dolby Atmos for Headphones. Surround juga butuh Sound Mode game (Options, Audio) di 5.1 atau 7.1."

#: launcher.cpp:421
msgid "Bypass sound effects"
msgstr "Lewati efek suara"

#: launcher.cpp:422
msgid "The game's sound skips Windows' and the sound card's effects (equalizers, loudness, virtual surround), where the device has a way past them."
msgstr "Suara game melewati efek Windows dan kartu suara (equalizer, loudness, virtual surround), bila perangkat punya cara untuk melewatinya."

#: launcher.cpp:424
msgid "Precompile music"
msgstr "Musik prakompilasi"

#: launcher.cpp:425
msgid "Music on the screen that builds the shaders at a version's first start, made by the program."
msgstr "Musik di layar yang mengompilasi shader saat sebuah versi pertama kali dijalankan, dibuat oleh program."

#: launcher.cpp:426
msgid "Optimise for this PC"
msgstr "Optimalkan untuk PC ini"

#: launcher.cpp:427
msgid "When the game's code is built, a training copy first plays the opening by itself, muted, in a window of its own (leave it open), and the build then uses what it counted: 2-3% more frames on the test laptop. It adds about 15 minutes to each build; if anything goes wrong there, the build goes on without it. Turned on after a build, Play builds the game's code again with it."
msgstr "Saat kode game dikompilasi, sebuah salinan latihan lebih dulu memainkan bagian pembuka sendiri, tanpa suara, di jendelanya sendiri (biarkan terbuka), lalu kompilasi memakai hasil hitungannya: di laptop uji, frame bertambah 2-3%. Waktu tiap kompilasi bertambah sekitar 15 menit; bila ada yang gagal di sana, kompilasi tetap berlanjut tanpanya. Bila diaktifkan setelah kompilasi, Mainkan mengompilasi ulang kode game dengannya."

#: launcher.cpp:431
msgid "Show this window at start"
msgstr "Tampilkan jendela ini saat mulai"

#: launcher.cpp:432
msgid "When off, hold Shift while the game starts to bring it back."
msgstr "Bila nonaktif, tahan Shift saat game dimulai untuk memunculkannya lagi."

#: launcher.cpp:433
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Periksa pembaruan"

#: launcher.cpp:434
msgid "At most every six hours, asks GitHub whether a newer release is out, and says so here with a link to it."
msgstr "Paling sering tiap enam jam, menanyakan ke GitHub apakah ada rilis yang lebih baru, lalu memberi tahu di sini dengan tautannya."

#: launcher.cpp:452
msgid "The PS3's SPU anti-aliasing, whose picture this port never shows, does no work: about 5% faster, and the bloom stays. AMD FSR and frame generation take the game's order without MLAA, which has no bloom or motion blur."
msgstr "Anti-aliasing SPU milik PS3, yang gambarnya tidak pernah ditampilkan port ini, tidak dijalankan: sekitar 5% fps lebih tinggi, dan bloom tetap ada. AMD FSR dan frame generation memakai urutan game tanpa MLAA, yang tidak punya bloom atau motion blur."

#: launcher.cpp:455
msgid "The blur of what lies outside the camera's focus."
msgstr "Efek buram pada apa pun di luar fokus kamera."

#: launcher.cpp:456
msgid "No blur of what moves fast. With AMD FSR or frame generation it never reaches the screen anyway, and they keep its draws, for what moves."
msgstr "Tanpa buram pada benda yang bergerak cepat. Dengan AMD FSR atau frame generation efek ini memang tidak pernah sampai ke layar, dan keduanya tetap memakai gambarnya, untuk benda yang bergerak."

#: launcher.cpp:458
msgid "Keeps the triangles the game drops as too thin for its 720p grid. For Internal resolution above 720p: at 720p it only adds geometry (3% slower at the first level, 11% at the gate)."
msgstr "Mempertahankan segitiga yang dibuang game karena terlalu tipis untuk grid 720p-nya. Untuk Resolusi internal di atas 720p: pada 720p ini hanya menambah geometri (lebih lambat 3% saat di level pertama, 11% apabila di gerbang)."

#: launcher.cpp:461
msgid "No dynamic shadows: the biggest saving, about 25% faster in the Megaera fight."
msgstr "Tanpa bayangan dinamis: penghematan terbesar, sekitar 25% fps lebih tinggi dalam pertarungan melawan Megaera."

