#: launcher.cpp:4648
msgid "The report is a zip file for you to attach to an issue on GitHub. The game sends nothing by itself.\n\nIt holds the logs of your last sessions, your button presses and the files the game opened in them, your settings, the log of building the game's code, this PC's hardware and driver versions, and Windows' records of crashes of this game.\n\nFolder paths and your Windows name are hidden. No game files are in it."
msgstr "Laporan ini berupa file zip untuk Anda lampirkan ke sebuah issue di GitHub. Game tidak mengirim apa pun sendiri.\n\nIsinya: log sesi terakhir Anda, tombol yang Anda tekan dan file yang dibuka game di sesi itu, pengaturan Anda, log kompilasi kode game, hardware PC ini dan versi driver-nya, serta catatan Windows tentang crash game ini.\n\nJalur folder dan nama Windows Anda disembunyikan. Tidak ada file game di dalamnya."

#: launcher.cpp:4655
