#: launcher.cpp:4895
msgid "ANR FG is Apex Neural Rendering's frame generation, by Apex Compute, in beta. It is not part of Ascension-R and has no licence of its own, so it is not in the download.\n\nAscension-R can download the newest release's addon zip (about 4 MB) from Apex Compute's own releases on GitHub (github.com/apex-compute/ANR), check it against the SHA-256 GitHub lists and Apex Compute's signature, and set it up in the anr folder beside the program. Nothing else is sent or installed."
msgstr "ANR FG adalah frame generation Apex Neural Rendering, buatan Apex Compute, masih beta. ANR FG bukan bagian dari Ascension-R dan tidak punya lisensi sendiri, jadi tidak disertakan dalam unduhan.\n\nAscension-R bisa mengunduh zip addon dari rilis terbaru (sekitar 4 MB) dari halaman rilis Apex Compute sendiri di GitHub (github.com/apex-compute/ANR), memeriksanya dengan SHA-256 yang tercantum di GitHub dan tanda tangan Apex Compute, lalu memasangnya di folder anr di samping program. Tidak ada hal lain yang dikirim atau dipasang."

#: launcher.cpp:4903 launcher.cpp:4955
