#: launcher.cpp:4943
msgid "%ls Its DLL is NVIDIA's, under NVIDIA's RTX SDK license, so it is not in the download.\n\nAscension-R can download %ls from NVIDIA's own DLSS repository on GitHub (github.com/NVIDIA/DLSS), check it against the SHA-256 Ascension-R keeps and NVIDIA's signature, and put it in the dlss folder beside the program. Nothing else is sent or installed."
msgstr "%ls DLL-nya milik NVIDIA, di bawah lisensi RTX SDK NVIDIA, jadi tidak disertakan dalam unduhan.\n\nAscension-R bisa mengunduh %ls dari repositori DLSS milik NVIDIA sendiri di GitHub (github.com/NVIDIA/DLSS), memeriksanya dengan SHA-256 yang disimpan Ascension-R dan tanda tangan NVIDIA, lalu menaruhnya di folder dlss di samping program. Tidak ada hal lain yang dikirim atau dipasang."

#: launcher.cpp:4947
msgid "NVIDIA DLSS frame generation makes a frame between each two with NVIDIA's own model, on GeForce RTX 40 and newer cards."
msgstr "Frame generation NVIDIA DLSS membuat satu frame di antara tiap dua frame dengan model milik NVIDIA sendiri, di kartu GeForce RTX 40 dan yang lebih baru."

#: launcher.cpp:4949
